# ColdOps environment.
#
# GENERATED FILE -- do not edit by hand.
#   cd apps/api && python -m coldops.cli env-example > ../../.env.example
#
# Every variable below is declared in coldops/config.py. Nothing else in
# the codebase reads configuration, so this file is exhaustive by
# construction rather than by discipline.
